WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.360
Finally,
Yoshimori and Kaguro fight...

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.070
Right when Kaguro's sword
was about to cut through Kagemiya...

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:19.310
Yoshimori unleashed a power
no one had ever seen before.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:24.910
Kaguro disappeared when hit
with that overwhelming power.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:36.800
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.670
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:43.870
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.770
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:49.210
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:53.610
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.150
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.490
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:06.150
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.660
Sha la la la la...

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.070
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.040
(Secret romance)

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:24.250
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.010
(A strange distance)

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:32.850
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:33.920
Yeah

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:37.390
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:41.000
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.330
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:09.120
What are you trying to do?!

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.280
Yoshimori!

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:14.360
Wake up!

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.790
First, I have to read
the range of the technique...

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:20.870
And then feel the wavelengths.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.540
Wake up!

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:36.280
Yoshimori!

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.510
Tokine...

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:50.720
Now!

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:53.900
Yoshimori!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.780
Are you all right, Chief?

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:14.750
Yeah...
That was close.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.620
I'm sorry...

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.050
You're so reckless.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.960
Now let's go home.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.300
Look! Kokuboro!

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:37.370
Kokuboro...

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.000
It's crumbling away.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:49.550
Byaku.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:55.290
What? This castle is done for!
Go away! You useless thing!

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.060
I have no need of you.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:03:59.360
Don't come near me.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.790
Don't look at me.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:15.440
Let's leave.
You don't like damp places, do you?

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.590
Looks like this is it.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.380
I really liked this place...

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.120
All right, guys.
Let's get out of here.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.360
Abandoning the castle and escaping?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.100
Well, so am I.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.660
Hekian...

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.340
Let me tell you
a good piece of information.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:44.870
The portal we've been using is
being guarded by the Night Troops.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.150
So, here's the deal.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:53.220
There are tears
opening up everywhere.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:57.090
I can find the other exits
with my Thousand Eyes.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.750
In return, why don't you become
my bodyguard, Shion?

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.870
What happened to your
overly polite talking style?

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.620
Byaku's worm is out of me.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.960
I don't need to suck up
to him anymore...

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.470
It was actually a huge pain.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.740
I'm sure you hated
being there, too.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.770
I liked that place.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:23.450
I just did a little work, they
gave me a comfortable place to live

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.540
and things to pass the time.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.210
You're strange.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.920
Well, I'm going to use
the experience I got here

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.860
and find a better master.

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:33.580
I know someone.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.950
If you want a comfortable
place to live,

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.730
I can introduce you to that person.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.660
That won't be possible.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.400
Because you're way too careless.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:48.540
I bet it was easy for Byaku
to implant his worm into you.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.540
But didn't he do
the same to you?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.570
I was faking.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.250
You acting like my equal
greatly annoys me.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.520
Even Byaku knew how to talk to me.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:03.150
As a puppet master,
I wouldn't lose to Byaku!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.800
Now, lead the way, Hekian.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.620
So long.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.700
Now get going, guys!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.470
You've gotten so much smaller.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:03.680
You probably think I'm just
a wrinkled old woman now.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:06.610
Don't underestimate me.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:11.550
I can still do some
incredible things.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.330
Is that a bird?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.800
No, it's not... That's...

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:26.530
Look!

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.540
The castle is disappearing

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:31.570
and the entire place is
turning into a golden field.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:33.640
This is...

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.140
A field of pampas grass.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:43.580
Masamori.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:46.420
Is that the Monster Fox
of the Black Pampas Grass?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:51.530
Leave her be.
It's her final performance.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.810
The Monster Fox of
the Black Pampas Grass...

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:11.820
Here, another powerful land
and its master will disappear.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:18.890
Byaku. Pluck one for me.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:31.440
Isn't this great?
I can still do things like this.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:36.040
I've known all along
that you are amazing...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.300
Ever since the first time we met...

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:55.060
Lowly human... Just because
you can command some bugs,

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.530
did you really think you stood
a chance against me?

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:01.070
Well, I suppose you
helped me pass some time.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.300
Oh?

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:12.010
You look complicated,
but you're actually very plain.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.300
How interesting.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:19.380
You may have come
in search of power

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:22.190
but that's not your true wish.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.120
W-What do you mean?

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.160
Think about that on your own.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:38.370
My goal was to
become an Ayakashi.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:44.240
I needed power to become one
so I challenged you, Princess.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:50.380
You're not going to find
the answer by taking care of me.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.680
How stupid.

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:58.850
I don't understand why humans
worry over the things they do.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.160
You already know the answer.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:06.930
I want to run through a field
of pampas grass once more.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.530
If I can do that,

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:12.400
I might just turn you
into a full Ayakashi.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.100
Though I did not find my answer...

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.870
Being with you gave me
peace of mind...

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:26.750
I had thought of this all along,
but now I understand.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:30.380
I now know why I couldn't
become a full Ayakashi...

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.620
I now know what I had sought...

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:38.730
I guess I wanted... to become human.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:45.940
I was such a fool. I thought I felt
uneasy around humans

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.910
because I was disgusted
by their humanity.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:55.040
They seemed so bright
and so far from what I am.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:11:01.280
How stupid. You took so long
just to come up with that answer.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:02.620
Yes.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:09.000
I couldn't present
Karasumori to you.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.160
I'm very sorry.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:17.000
How stupid... I just like to
demand the impossible...

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:26.240
I healed your wounds...
You should have escaped...

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:31.080
Humans... are so...

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.150
...silly...

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:39.550
Yes...

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.000
He's breathing so
he should be fine, right?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.200
He's an idiot,
but he's a strong kid.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:53.840
Of course he'll be fine.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:56.530
Yoshimori!

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.370
Tokine!
Kagemiya!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.150
I'm glad you're both okay.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.720
This isn't the time for you to be
worrying about others! You fool!

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.050
Grandpa Shige!
Why are you here?!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.220
I'll lecture you later! We have to
get out of this place first.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:20.990
Where's Kaguro?

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:21.890
Gone.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:22.760
Gone?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.840
He was disintegrated,

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.770
with that thing of yours
that was like the Zekkai.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.040
You won.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.740
Sorry... for interfering
with your battle.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.750
That's okay.
I didn't go there just for a duel.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:45.290
All right. Yoshimori seems fine.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.990
But now we're in danger.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.170
I don't know if we can
reach the passage

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.390
before we get caught in that...

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:53.730
Hakota!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:54.500
Yes, sir!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.530
Is there another exit aside
from that passageway?!

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:02.640
No, we need to use the same
passage we came in from.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.410
But we have to hurry.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.800
The passage was
created by a Kekkaishi.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.880
It's less likely to be affected
by the disintegration.

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:12.280
On top of that, a very powerful
caster is standing by.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.180
I can't let her do all the work.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:21.750
Masamori... You focus too much
on the destructive aspects...

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:26.470
but Kekkai can also be used
to connect and create.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.220
Just watch.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.370
Wow!

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.250
It's only for a little while,

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.410
but I will suspend
the destruction around us!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.110
Hurry up while I hold it at bay!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.260
The Chief and the others are late...

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.000
The collapse is getting close!

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.810
The tail is being swallowed up.

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:12.810
Ugh!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:14.610
Just a little bit longer!

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:21.420
We don't have time. I will extend
the passage and pull them out.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.080
There!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.350
This is it!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.470
Tokiko!

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:52.920
Stand back everyone!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.610
- Chief!
- Chief!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.000
Chief, you're all right!

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:18.570
Damn it!
What was with this landing?!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.840
That's because you
didn't break your fall.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.000
Yup.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:26.480
But... we're back.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:32.290
Yoshimori.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:32.950
Yeah?

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.300
Don't go doing things
on your own!

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:49.000
You're always so reckless!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.740
But what you did this time was

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.540
the stupidest and worst thing
you've ever done!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.280
Do you know how much trouble
you caused?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.380
Do you know how many
people worried about you?

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.150
Sorry...

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:02.980
I won't forgive you...

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.050
Huh?

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.750
I'm never going to forgive you.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:11.000
If you keep this up...
and I lose you, too... I...

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:20.030
I, uh... Oh... I... Um...
Sorry.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:25.240
Tokine... Um...
Sorry. I said I'm sorry.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:31.410
I... I'm just stupid...
So I had to go...

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:37.380
I couldn't move on
unless I avenged Shishio...

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:42.950
I'm sorry...
Anyways I'm just... sorry.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:55.970
Toki...

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.600
You still don't understand
the most important thing.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:04.280
It's the same way
you felt about Gen-kun...

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.350
There are people who get hurt
when you get hurt.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.750
Please take better care
of yourself.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:15.020
Sorry...

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:20.460
Yoshimori!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.230
Yoshimori!

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.170
Yoshimori!

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:25.300
Oh... He's...

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.470
He's asleep.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.910
You say he's asleep?!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:32.900
Yes. Look.
He's all limp!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:34.240
Geez.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:38.920
I'm sorry.
I hit you a little too hard.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:40.980
Hey, beast girl.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:42.680
- How hard did you hit him?
- Mukade, can you give us a hand?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.520
- Sen-chan.
- Yes, sir.

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:45.390
- You got a problem with me?
- Chief, you should hold him better.

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:46.430
You went too far.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:49.290
I suppose I don't need to
lecture him anymore on this matter.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.000
You're too lenient.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:54.360
The Sumimura family allows
such reckless behavior?

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.930
Don't call it reckless!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.170
After all is said and done,

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:01.500
he destroyed the Kokuboro
all by himself!

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.210
You think he's great
because he crushed

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.680
something that was
already breaking?

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.210
What?!
The Yukimura family is reckless!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.750
It's the Sumimuras!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:10.780
It's the Yukimuras!

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:11.890
Sumimuras.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:12.870
Yukimuras.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.360
Now then.
Thank you for everything.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.530
We'll come again
if anything happens...

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:29.870
You can come back anytime...
This is your home.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:31.600
All right.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.470
Yoshimori. Don't be reckless.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:37.740
Yeah... You, too.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.110
Yoshimori!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:41.270
How dare you speak to
your elder brother like that!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:44.540
Stop pushing me.

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:47.140
Yoshimori-kun!

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:51.420
I wanted to talk to you more,
but maybe next time. Take care.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:52.980
Come on, Sen-chan.
Say something.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.720
See ya.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.120
Yeah.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:18:59.390
Bye.

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:01.290
Masamori.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:05.630
You should take some time off
and come home.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.840
The Night Troops are
a big group now.

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:11.710
We have to do more missions
to stay in business!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.580
Everyone, return to headquarters
and to your next post.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:19.810
Dismissed!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.750
They're gone.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.960
What a relief!

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.150
Yoshimori!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.430
Now let's have dinner.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:32.360
Yeah.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.380
Grandpa Shige!
You took my omelet!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:48.340
Quiet! You stop drinking
coffee milk during meals!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:51.290
You're Japanese,
drink miso soup! Miso soup!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.920
That's none of your business!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.050
- Miso soup!
- Toshimori,

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.060
- Coffee milk!
- eat your green peppers.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:55.710
Okay...

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:00.090
Shuji-san. Where is Yoshimori?

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:05.460
He went to work... I told him that
he should take the day off, but...

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.770
He can't be considered
the Legitimate Heir

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:12.170
if he neglects his main duty
because of that little incident.

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:18.870
But I wouldn't have minded
taking his place for tonight.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:24.880
I'm sure he saw
the extent of

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.910
his tremendous power
at Kokuboro...

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:35.430
But if he can return to his
daily life this easily after that,

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.320
he should be fine.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:40.730
Hey, hey!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.190
Ketsu!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.810
Oh, man. I don't know
what you did at Kokuboro,

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:51.870
but you haven't changed at all!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:54.210
People don't change that easily.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:58.010
I thought you
became a bit smarter...

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.050
Sorry I'm late.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.520
You're totally late!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.960
Tokiko gave her a good scolding.

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:07.180
Hakubi!

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.050
Tokine.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:13.000
She scolded me
for going after you.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:14.760
Sorry.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:19.130
That again? I'm tired of listening
to your insincere apologies.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:24.700
I guess so. I always say sorry
and then go off on my own.

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:27.540
If you're really sorry,
then don't overwork yourself.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:28.540
Huh?

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:31.740
Grandma scolded me...

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.010
But I don't regret
doing what I did.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:40.460
I don't think I could
stand being here

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:44.190
while you were
at Kokuboro...

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:52.200
Despite everything,
those two make a good team.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:53.670
Like us?

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:57.270
Yeah, right. You're still way
too young and inexperienced.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:00.040
Don't make fun of me
just because I'm younger.

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:01.610
You're just a decrepit old dog!

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.110
How dare you call me decrepit!

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:05.590
Here it comes!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:06.570
It's a huge one!

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:11.120
All right! Hoi!

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:12.650
Joso!

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:16.860
The ambitions of the Kokuboro
have been defeated.

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:18.560
- But...
- Ketsu!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:20.430
that doesn't mean that all Ayakashi
who seek Karasumori

00:22:20.470 --> 00:22:22.200
have disappeared.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:25.670
As long as Karasumori exists,

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:28.730
Sumimura Yoshimori and
Yukimura Tokine

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:30.540
will continue to fight.

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:32.100
- Metsu!
- Metsu!

00:22:38.450 --> 00:22:46.160
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:52.860
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.430 --> 00:23:02.240
Joking around, I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:08.580
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:18.420
You don't have to say anything, it's okay

00:23:19.730 --> 00:23:24.790
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:33.870
Straight ahead, I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:41.410
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:50.390
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.390 --> 00:23:58.960
The red string connects one to another
